+5. **Vectorization coverage.** Run `"vmap over QR decomposition"` in `test/lax-linalg.test.ts`.
+6. **Dispatch-path confirmation.** Keep the WASM-specific code-capture assertions in
+  `test/code-capture.test.ts` so the QR tests can prove they are exercising the QR routine path on
